# Canonical, protected content — maintainer review required on any PR that
# touches it. This is the PR-side counterpart to the editor's clone-on-edit:
# contributors add maps under maps/community/ (open), never edit core/ or the
# baked assets directly.
#
# NOTE: listing a user here does NOT grant them access — it REQUESTS their
# review on matching paths, and GitHub silently ignores owners who lack write
# access to the repo. Anyone can already fork + PR (the repo is public; that's
# what the editor's Submit button automates). So every name below must also be
# a collaborator with write access.
# maps/curated/** is the flagship ROM's map list: promotion into it is a
# maintainer decision, so it is review-gated exactly like core. maps/community/**
# stays open — that content ships only in backrooms-community.32x and in the
# author's own build.
maps/core/**        @mholzinger @SmokeMonsterPacks
maps/curated/**     @mholzinger @SmokeMonsterPacks
sh_src/*_tex.h      @mholzinger @SmokeMonsterPacks
registry.json       @mholzinger @SmokeMonsterPacks
tools/gen_maps.py   @mholzinger @SmokeMonsterPacks
tools/lint_maps.py  @mholzinger @SmokeMonsterPacks
